----------------------- Amazon Beanstalk ------------------------

- Amazon Beanstalk is a platform as a service (PAAS).

- Purpose :-
1. Suppose we have a code or docker images or any legacy code we can directly run that as PAAS (Elastic Beanstalk). 
2. So when we run that so their scaling, maintenance, security and load balancing will all be handle by the Elastic Beanstalk.
3. So we don't need to worry about the underlying infrastructure.

Launch:-
1. First time create in 2011 and now again revamped.
2. They have standard mode (Run on EC2 instance) and cluster mode (Run on EKS cluster).

